 "brief": "Dozens of Moroccans gathered outside parliament in Rabat on Wednesday to demand an end to normalization with Israel and express solidarity with Palestinians, Shehab Wire reported. The protesters called for a complete halt to all forms of normalization and increased support for Palestinian resistance.\n\nThe demonstration reflected ongoing public opposition in Morocco to diplomatic ties with Israel, established in 2020 as part of U.S.-brokered agreements.",
